{
    "title": "Rappi: Food Delivery, Grocery",
    "description": "<b><h1>Order with Rappi. We deliver anything, anywhere, anytime \u2013 within minutes.</h1></b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2><b>Rappi offers the best of your city, delivered in minutes: Order food, groceries, liquor, convenience, pharmacies, flowers, and much more from over 200,000 restaurants and convenience stores in more than 300 cities in Latin America. </b></h2>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>ENJOY THE BEST EXPERIENCE</h3>\r\n<li>Order delivery ASAP, or schedule for later at your convenience</li>\r\n<li>Real-time tracking: See when your order will arrive and receive delivery notifications. </li>\r\n<li>Pay in cash, your debit or credit card, or with Apple Pay. </li>\r\n<li>Send as a gift with a personalized card and pamper your loved ones. </li>\r\n<li>Subscribe to Rappi Pro and enjoy unlimited FREE shipping, members-only discounts, and more exclusive benefits.</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>EVERYTHING YOU NEED IN MINUTES </h3>\r\n<li>Find your favorites: Order McDonald's, KFC, Little Caesar's, Starbucks, and much more. </li>\r\n<li>Find tasty cravings: Tacos, burgers, pizzas, coffee, healthy options, sushi, and much more. </li>\r\n<li>Order groceries in just a few taps: Find the same discounts as in store, delivered to you in minutes. T&C apply. </li>\r\n<li>Ultra fast deliveries \u2013 get food in 10 minutes: Order McDonald\u2019s, Little Caesar\u2019s, and more with Turbo Restaurants. </li>\r\n<li>Find what you need ASAP: More than 2,000 convenience products delivered in 10 minutes with Turbo. </li>\r\n<li>Stores and Pharmacies: Find thousands of products from your go-to pharmacies and grocery stores. </li>\r\n<li>Liquors and convenience: Everything you need for a spectacular gathering. Order from your local favorites to get everything you need. </li>\r\n<li>Pets: Thousands of products to pamper your furry ones.</li>\r\n\r\n<h3>SUBSCRIBE TO THE PRO SIDE OF RAPPI </h3>\r\n<li>Get unlimited FREE deliveries and thousands of deals up to 50% in exclusive discounts. Plu get your first 30 days are free, then your membership renews automatically. Cancel at any time.</li>\r\n\r\n<h3>OTHER PRODUCTS</h3>\r\n<li>Messaging and Shipping: We bring you whatever you need with a Rappi Favor. </li>\r\n<li>Rappi Bank & Rappi Card: Enjoy our credit card with no annual fee that offers cashback, maximum security, and 24/7 customer service. </li>\r\n<li>Rappi Travel: Plan your trips with exclusive offers.</li>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><h1>Order with Rappi. We deliver anything, anywhere, anytime \u2013 within minutes.</h1></b><br><br><br><h2><b>Rappi offers the best of your city, delivered in minutes: Order food, groceries, liquor, convenience, pharmacies, flowers, and much more from over 200,000 restaurants and convenience stores in more than 300 cities in Latin America. </b></h2><br><br><br><h3>ENJOY THE BEST EXPERIENCE</h3><br><li>Order delivery ASAP, or schedule for later at your convenience</li><br><li>Real-time tracking: See when your order will arrive and receive delivery notifications. </li><br><li>Pay in cash, your debit or credit card, or with Apple Pay. </li><br><li>Send as a gift with a personalized card and pamper your loved ones. </li><br><li>Subscribe to Rappi Pro and enjoy unlimited FREE shipping, members-only discounts, and more exclusive benefits.</li><br><br><br><h3>EVERYTHING YOU NEED IN MINUTES </h3><br><li>Find your favorites: Order McDonald&#39;s, KFC, Little Caesar&#39;s, Starbucks, and much more. </li><br><li>Find tasty cravings: Tacos, burgers, pizzas, coffee, healthy options, sushi, and much more. </li><br><li>Order groceries in just a few taps: Find the same discounts as in store, delivered to you in minutes. T&amp;C apply. </li><br><li>Ultra fast deliveries \u2013 get food in 10 minutes: Order McDonald\u2019s, Little Caesar\u2019s, and more with Turbo Restaurants. </li><br><li>Find what you need ASAP: More than 2,000 convenience products delivered in 10 minutes with Turbo. </li><br><li>Stores and Pharmacies: Find thousands of products from your go-to pharmacies and grocery stores. </li><br><li>Liquors and convenience: Everything you need for a spectacular gathering. Order from your local favorites to get everything you need. </li><br><li>Pets: Thousands of products to pamper your furry ones.</li><br><br><h3>SUBSCRIBE TO THE PRO SIDE OF RAPPI </h3><br><li>Get unlimited FREE deliveries and thousands of deals up to 50% in exclusive discounts. Plu get your first 30 days are free, then your membership renews automatically. Cancel at any time.</li><br><br><h3>OTHER PRODUCTS</h3><br><li>Messaging and Shipping: We bring you whatever you need with a Rappi Favor. </li><br><li>Rappi Bank &amp; Rappi Card: Enjoy our credit card with no annual fee that offers cashback, maximum security, and 24/7 customer service. </li><br><li>Rappi Travel: Plan your trips with exclusive offers.</li>",
